<title>USA: Return of refugees may change Zaire mission - Perry.</title>
<headline>Return of refugees may change Zaire mission - Perry.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Defense Secretary William Perry said on Saturday the rapidly changing situation of refugees streaming back into Rwanda from Zaire could force a change in plans for sending a multinational force to provide humanitarian aid.</p>
<p>Perry said the United States will consult with its allies after receiving a report this weekend from a survey team in the area. &quot;It is possible our plan and the allies' plan at that stage will be modified as a result of these developments,&quot; he said at a news conference.</p>
</text>
